{"v":4,"catch":"向老派的街機和平台經典致敬！","desc":"V.O.I.D.是一款側滾動作式的冒險遊戲，它採用了8位元和16位元的最佳，並將此經典與現代科技互相融合。      \n有兩個角色可以選擇，每個角色都具有不同能力。V.O.I.D. 可以作為跳躍和跑動的平台遊戲或跑動和槍的動作遊戲。當你使用不同的角色進行遊戲時，解鎖不同的路線。          \n拯救你的星球，它正被另一個星系的邪惡種族入侵。 穿越時間去獲得神聖的寶石，你將得到足夠的力量來打敗邪惡的侵略者。","publisher":"eastasiasoft","release":"2020-01-16","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aff9e7756686c199a84df4efd34e37d99155a04393384cb25e8aaca3ab6d97c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6bbeee6aadc6b01bf1e5ac423665332e962549faf32ef75edf1327b25c965124.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c11f243fb683f4cc6c282740cf54fded5daa6cebbb600ea0b10da822c531902.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b38778c9c51fdde1b9739213f2b839f2afc8d77d30ec27ca5f58dc860b1e677.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12e9ea8860a5db62dea28d1e2aa09e35e2f4d28c76f34ff5c4decd4333f61402.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/597b60938b173d7ec1b0deca356c84ee8acbe76ff378fa90a3e86c2d99c7de17.jpg"],"titleId":"01004ab00d978000","dlc":[]}